sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Usuário
    box rgb(227,242,253) Navegador — SPA Angular, origem localhost:4200
        participant LC as LoginComponent
        participant LS as LoginService
    end
    box rgb(232,245,233) Servidor de Aplicação — Spring Boot, porta 8080
        participant DS as DispatcherServlet
        participant CT as AuthController
        participant SV as AuthService
        participant RP as JpaUserRepository
        participant PH as Argon2PasswordHasher
    end
    box rgb(243,229,245) Repositório de Dados
        participant DB as PostgreSQL
    end

    U->>LC: e-mail, senha, "Entrar"
    LC->>LS: login(email, senha)
    LS-)DS: OPTIONS /api/auth/login (pré-verificação CORS)
    DS--)LS: 200 OK, Access-Control-Allow-Origin
    LS-)DS: POST /api/auth/login {email, senha}
    activate DS
    Note over DS: JSON → LoginRequest<br/>normalização e @Valid
    DS->>CT: login(requisicao)
    activate CT
    CT->>SV: autenticar(email, senha)
    activate SV
    SV->>RP: buscarPorEmail(email)
    RP->>DB: SELECT … FROM usuarios WHERE email = ?
    DB-->>RP: 1 linha
    RP-->>SV: Optional[Usuario]
    SV->>PH: verificar(senha, senhaHash)
    PH-->>SV: true
    SV-->>CT: ResultadoAutenticacao.sucesso
    deactivate SV
    Note over CT: registra tentativa SUCESSO
    CT-->>DS: ResponseEntity 200 (LoginResponse)
    deactivate CT
    DS--)LS: 200 OK {autenticado: true, usuario}
    deactivate DS
    LS-->>LC: LoginResponse
    LC-->>U: exibe usuário autenticado
